WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:07.680
In one cross test, SCP-682, the Hard to Destroy
Reptile, was made to face off against SCP-1361,

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.560
a giant, aggressive mass of animal slurry
that envelops and digests everything it touches,

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.120
before briefly taking on their traits.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:22.400
Just over 1000 kilograms of SCP-1361 was poured
onto SCP-682, and it successfully enveloped

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.280
the creature.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.520
The problem was that it then began taking
on traits and a temperament incredibly similar

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:33.920
to SCP-682 - After developing legs, jaws and
other physical features similar to the reptile,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.520
it broke out of containment and killed seventeen
members of staff.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.600
After several failed attempts to stop the
creature with small arms fire, it was finally

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.320
destroyed by the aerial deployment of napalm.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:49.040
682’s skeletal carcass was retrieved from
within and placed back in its chamber.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.760
It had regenerated back to perfect health
within a mere six hours.

